---
description: No comments in code
alwaysApply: true
---

No comments in code. Agents must never add comments. Encode non-obvious invariants in names, types, or tests instead.

A tool directive may stay only when a tool reads that exact line (`# type: ignore`, `# noqa`, `eslint-disable`, `@ts-expect-error`, a shebang, or an encoding line). Do not add a reason after it.
